    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Clarke Auctioneers Ltd are delighted to bring to market 10 Highfield Court, a well presented, 3-bed, apartment ready and waiting for prospective purchasers.\n\nThis spacious duplex apartment is situated front of the popular Highfield Court development. The balcony to the rear is easterly facing and is a generous size. Accommodation briefly comprises: First Floor: Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen/Dining,WC, Bathroom and balcony. First Floor: Bedroom 1, Ensuite, Bedroom 2, Bedroom 3 and family bathroom.\n\nNo. 10 is fitted with double glazed windows throughout and uses a gas fired central heating system. The property has been completely redecorated throughout and is being sold with all the furniture, fixtures and fittings. The property was rented until May 2025 when the tenant left of their own accord. Number 10 has been vacant for 15 months and is an ideal first home or potential investment property. \n\nHighfield Court enjoys an enviable location within easy walking distance to Wicklow Town centre, Wicklow Train Station, beautiful Wicklow Harbour and a host of local amenities in this thriving seaside town. Tesco and Lidl are less than five minutes walk. The development is mature and has been well-maintained and managed over the years. The annual service charges are approx 1,000 per annum, which includes grounds maintenance and insurance. Number 10 would represent an ideal purchase for a variety of buyers including first time purchasers, investors or those looking to down size to a more manageable property. \n\nThe property is conveniently located for access to the M11/M50 and Wicklow railway station. Wicklow town offers excellent primary and secondary schools, a variety of shops pubs and restaurants. Every activity is catered for in this beautiful harbour town with an array of clubs and activities as well as a state of the art library. Highfield Court is within easy reach of Silver Strand, Brittas Bay and numerous scenic mountain and sea-side walks including the cliff walk to Wicklow head lighthouse. For the avid golfer, Wicklow Golf Club, Blainroe and the world renowned European Club are within fifteen minutes drive. Wicklow has excellent public transport facilities with an excellent bus service and trains to Dublin."
      },
